      ],
      "message": "rpc: fix dumptxoutset rollback crash after loadtxoutset on pruned node\n\nOn a pruned node, dumptxoutset with rollback calls GetFirstBlock on the\nactive chain tip to check that the needed block data hasn't been\npruned. GetFirstBlock asserts that the block it starts from has block\nand undo data. Right after loadtxoutset the active tip is the snapshot\nbase block, which has neither until it is downloaded, so the call\naborts bitcoind:\n\n  Assertion failed: ((last_block->nStatus & status_mask) == status_mask),\n  function GetFirstBlock, file blockstorage.cpp\n\nReturn the existing \"necessary block data is already pruned\" error when\nthe tip itself has no data.",
